    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/67d9c34a8fa7a672d8c94f26fe8c2755.avif?t=1748693393\" width=616 height=362 /></span>An experimental accident in theoretical physics occurred in Qianhai City, leaving the local law enforcement agencies clueless, forcing them to seek assistance from you, ITEO Special Investigator Zenmeil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/05cad0c94976bbb6e9ffac532efd80ba.avif?t=1748693393\" width=616 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the cause of the accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/544b6bdea1944aace78cb1af4be968ad.avif?t=1748693393\" width=616 height=362 /></span>Enter the inner world of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/58ba5316d8c2e807bceb7b08e0ca10e3.avif?t=1748693393\" width=616 height=362 /></span>Explore the secrets of the inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/3c7e859cd8b6c6d1bd0f1efb14fb13fe.avif?t=1748693393\" width=616 height=362 /></span>Encounter and resolve battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/831cc989a1b672f72ad19159